cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these results, please cite the article below."
title: "Chemical risk factors for breast cancer from gene expression profiles"
abstract: >-
  Code and results underlying the study ranking chemicals as candidate breast
  cancer risk factors by comparing their transcriptional footprint in MCF7
  (LINCS/CMap L1000) with the deregulation observed between TCGA-BRCA tumours
  and GTEx normal breast tissue.
